{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も、あかさたなはまやらわ色々\n頑張りました  （＾o＾）♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は、まだお月様見える時間に\nお家を出る毎日であります○°"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ってるから、\n皆さんにお届けするのが\n楽しみだなあ  **"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえばダンスの先生はいつも\n“今のラインが最低”と考えなさい\nとおっしゃいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今の現状より下はないと\n常に心に刻んで、\n上を目指すことだけを考える。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵だなあ ＋＋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これって、おみくじの大凶と\n同じようなことだよねっ  (*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大凶=大吉現象起こせるように\n頑張ろうっ！＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪  みんなも頑張ろう   ラララ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の映り込みかずみん、\n何故かサルのマネ(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/07/photo.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"からの、タツのマネ(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/07/image.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃん"}],"source":"archive"}